110
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:34,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you know him? He's the Crane
Hermit's younger brother, Tao Pai Pai...</font>

111
00:09:34,730 --> 00:09:37,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-Tao Pai Pai?!</font>

112
00:09:37,130 --> 00:09:39,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But didn't Goku?</font>

113
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:44,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He survived. And now he's half robot...</font>

114
