115
00:09:48,710 --> 00:09:51,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And he's up against
Tenshinhan in the first fight...</font>

116
00:09:51,310 --> 00:09:54,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai...</font>

117
00:09:54,750 --> 00:09:56,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This doesn't fare well, indeed...</font>

118
00:09:56,820 --> 00:10:00,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He knows all the tricks
