124
00:10:21,910 --> 00:10:23,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What did you say?!</font>

125
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:26,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me give you a little warning.</font>

126
00:10:26,050 --> 00:10:31,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">None of you Turtle Hermit dimwits better run
