129
00:10:39,890 --> 00:10:44,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They have all surpassed me and
are now following their own paths!</font>

130
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:48,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? Despite the fact that they're
all wearing Turtle Hermit uniforms?</font>

131
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:52,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Each decided on his own to wear a
uniform out of their feelings toward me.</font>

132
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:59,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right! Unlike you, people
actually respect Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i>!</font>

133
00:10:59,710 --> 00:11:04,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it, talk as big as you want...
while you still can.</font>

134
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:06,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you!</font>

135
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:13,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">When he became a cyborg, Tao Pai Pai
gained unimaginable strength!</font>

136
00:11:13,460 --> 00:11:18,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I would be surprised if Tenshinhan and
you boys had any chance of winning at all!</font>

137
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:25,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I just can't stand that senile bag of bones!</font>

138
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:30,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The <i>really</i> strong guy to
look out for isn't Tao Pai Pai.</font>

139
00:11:32,410 --> 00:11:35,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The fights will commence shortly.</i></font>

140
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:39,780
