144
00:11:52,970 --> 00:11:54,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But make sure not to overdo it, now!</font>

145
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Step down if need be!</font>

146
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Understood!</font>

147
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck, you guys!</font>

148
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:05,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha-<i>sama</i>! Win the championship!</font>

149
00:12:05,810 --> 00:12:07,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

150
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:15,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, I suppose this time I
