153
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:35,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Whatever should we do?</font>

154
00:12:35,710 --> 00:12:38,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pardon me, Lunch-<i>san</i>...</font>

155
00:12:43,980 --> 00:12:46,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry to ask you again, Lunch-<i>san</i>...</font>

156
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:49,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just leave it to me!</font>

157
00:12:58,730 --> 00:13:04,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Outta the way!
Unless you losers feel like dyin'!</font>

158
00:13:06,170 --> 00:13:07,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excuse us...</font>

159
00:13:10,710 --> 00:13:12,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say, Goku...</font>

160
00:13:12,710 --> 00:13:16,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai was a <i>really</i>
strong assassin, right?</font>

161
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:18,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And now he's even stronger than before,</font>

162
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:20,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so what's with this, "He's
nothing to worry about" stuff?</font>

163
00:13:20,550 --> 00:13:24,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Simple. Tenshinhan's <i>way</i> better than he is.</font>

164
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:31,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I dunno, he used to be sort of
like Tenshinhan's master, right?</font>

165
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say, want something good to eat?</font>

166
00:13:36,570 --> 00:13:38,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look!</font>

167
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:44,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you eat one of these,
