168
00:13:47,210 --> 00:13:52,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Senzu, right? Yamucha and I have some, too!</font>

169
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See?</font>

170
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:57,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? So that means that you guys...</font>

171
00:13:57,620 --> 00:14:03,230
