173
00:14:07,770 --> 00:14:11,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?! That's great!</font>

174
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:15,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There was this guy at the top...
Yajirobe is what I think Karin called him.</font>

175
00:14:15,810 --> 00:14:20,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He seemed pretty strong, so we
invited him to come to the tournament,</font>

176
00:14:20,180 --> 00:14:21,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but it doesn't look like he showed up.</font>

177
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:26,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He hates this sort of thing!</font>

178
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:29,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aw, shaddup! I got
