188
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:21,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The first match is between
Competitors Tao Pai Pai and Tenshinhan!</font>

189
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:26,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Would the fighters please enter the ring?</font>

190
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:33,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Beat that guy's brains out!</font>

191
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:35,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You got it!</font>

192
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:44,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck!</font>

193
