197
00:16:06,620 --> 00:16:07,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's one freaky-lookin' dude!</font>

198
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:10,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Beat the crap outta him, Tenshinhan!</font>

199
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:12,050
