200
00:16:15,530 --> 00:16:18,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the first match begin!</font>

201
00:16:22,470 --> 00:16:24,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you ready?</font>

202
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,110
